## Flow Diagram

```text
                    VehicleFactory
                          ▲
          ┌───────────────┴───────────────┐
          │                               │
    HondaFactory                    ToyotaFactory
          │                               │
    ┌─────┴─────┐                   ┌─────┴─────┐
    │           │                   │           │
HondaCar   HondaBike          ToyotaCar   ToyotaBike
```

---

## Key Takeaway

```text
Factory Pattern
    → Creates ONE Product

Abstract Factory Pattern
    → Creates a FAMILY of Related Products
```
